@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### All newsletters (superadmin only)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/notifications/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send a newsletter (superadmin only)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/notifications/send-newsletter
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Hello {username}",
  "message": "This newsletter was sent from notifications.http",
  "recipientType": "all"
}

### My notifications
GET http://localhost:3001/api/notifications/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark as viewed
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/notifications/mark-viewed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notificationIds": [1, 2] }

### Notification delivery log statistics (admin)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/notification-logs/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
